  "qualification": "Opening rectangles, cladding divisions, frame profiles, materials, bridge underside and occluded details are approximate source-informed estimates. Provider pixels are not bundled. Roof geometry and roof pixels are retained from the public survey. No interiors. Window levels and group boundaries are digitized from private survey-aligned source projections; hidden lower openings and opposite bridge windows remain estimates. Ground continues from DGM1, retains DOP20 appearance and avoids prior surface overlap. Tree forms/species are inferred from public canopy data. An estimated 2.5m outer shoulder joins retained source ground using sampled height residuals; the transition is not measured DGM terrain. The20m study envelope covers walking approaches. Mapped asphalt and grass use pinned OSM; low green ground below0.7m DOM-DGM is a separate lawn inference. Outer ground joins are estimated from source residuals.",
